      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nEveryone shall have the right to recognition everywhere as a person before\nthe law.",
      "skos:definition": "Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nEveryone shall have the right to recognition everywhere as a person before\nthe law.",
      "cml:asserts": [
