      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986.pdf, p.139",
      "values:originalText": "Any propaganda for war shall be prohibited by law.\n2.\nAny advocacy of national, racial or religious hatred that constitutes\nincitement to discrimination, hostility or violence shall be prohibited by law.",
      "skos:definition": "Any propaganda for war shall be prohibited by law.\n2.\nAny advocacy of national, racial or religious hatred that constitutes\nincitement to discrimination, hostility or violence shall be prohibited by law.",
