      "dc:source": "australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986.pdf, p.143",
      "values:originalText": "Assembly of the United Nations, receive emoluments from United Nations\nresources on such terms and conditions as the General Assembly may decide,\nhaving regard to the importance of the Committee’s responsibilities.",
      "skos:definition": "Assembly of the United Nations, receive emoluments from United Nations\nresources on such terms and conditions as the General Assembly may decide,\nhaving regard to the importance of the Committee’s responsibilities.",
